{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Pharaoh's chariots.</b> That they were heavy, and his army with them — as though He shot them like an arrow, which is light:" "Since he mentioned his army, he mentioned his third-commanders, who were over all of it:" "And Yefet said that Yam Suf is like קָנֶה וָסוּף קָמַל (Isaiah 19:6), and he stated בְסוּף (above, v. 2) because Yam Suf has קָנֶה וָסוּף around it and not around other seas. And R. Yeshuah said: it is a place-name, like Yam Kinneret (Joshua 13:27)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:38.148808120Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}